{"articleNo":"221300","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=221300&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대학본부] 교직원 및 재학생을 위한 항공권 할인 프로모션 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2019.03.29","hit":"5132","attachments":[{"name":"항공권 할인 프로모션 안내 1부.jpg","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=221300&attachNo=64269"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"fr-view\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움;\">금오공과대학교 교직원 및 재학생을 위한 항공권 프로모션을&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움;\">아래와 같이 안내하오니</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움; font-size: 15px;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움; font-size: 15px;\">관심있는 분들은 참고하시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움; font-size: 15px;\">.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움; font-size: 15px;\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움; font-size: 15px;\">항공사&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움; font-size: 15px;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움; font-size: 15px;\">티웨이항공</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움; font-size: 15px;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움; font-size: 15px;\">대상노선 및 할인율&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움; font-size: 15px;\">: <strong>첨부자료 참고</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움;\"></span><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움;\">3.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움; font-size: 15px;\">대상&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움; font-size: 15px;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움; font-size: 15px;\">금오공과대학교 재학생 본인 및 교직원 본인 그리고 동반&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움; font-size: 15px;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움; font-size: 15px;\">인</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움;\">4.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움; font-size: 15px;\">기타&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움; font-size: 15px;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움; font-size: 15px;\">공항에서 학생증 및 교직원증 확인 후 수속 가능&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움; font-size: 15px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;(</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움; font-size: 15px;\">미 지참시 공항에서 추가 요금 부과 가능으로 필히 지참 요망</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움; font-size: 15px;\">)&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움;\">5.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움; font-size: 15px;\">예약방법&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움; font-size: 15px;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움; font-size: 15px;\">티웨이항공 홈페이지에서 프로모션 코드 입력 후 예약시 자동적용</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움;\">6.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움; font-size: 15px;\">프로모션 코드&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움; font-size: 15px;\">: <strong>첨부자료 참고</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움;\"></span><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움;\">7.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움; font-size: 15px;\">문의사항&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움; font-size: 15px;\">: 053-712-6342.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움; font-size: 15px;\">붙임 &nbsp;항공권 할인 프로모션 안내 1부. &nbsp;끝.&nbsp;</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
